 "Exile API needs the Microsoft .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, which is not installed. Open the download page now? Choose the Desktop Runtime for Windows x64, install it, then start Path of Exile access again.": "Exile API 需要 Microsoft .NET 10 Desktop Runtime，但尚未安裝。要現在開啟下載頁面嗎？請選擇 Windows x64 版的 Desktop Runtime，安裝後再重新啟動 Path of Exile access。",
